    },
    "No header row, so the columns were taken in the order above. Add a header line and they can be in any order — and you can leave out the ones you do not have." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "見出し行がないので、列は上の順番で読み取りました。見出し行を付ければ順番は自由になり、手元にない列は省けます。"
